# =============================================
# NOTE: Research data is NOT ignored
# The following extensions are intentionally tracked:
#   .pdf  .csv  .xlsx  .json  .png  .tm7  .html  .md  .bib  .tex  .cls  .sty
#
# Key folders with tracked research files:
#   Scenario*_Expert_Reference_Baseline_FINAL.csv — expert-vetted reference threat baselines
#   data/          — raw experimental outputs and architectures (scenarios 1-3)
#   prompts/       — standardized experimental prompt packages
#   results/       — empirical analysis, workbooks, and evidence audit datasets
#   thesis/        — compiled thesis PDF monograph
# =============================================

